      "id": "claim_ceae1411fc924dd9b307f1342b520cfe",
      "statement": "The workflow is split into three owned boundaries: proposer drafts and reviews candidate OKF content but does not publish resources, authoring owns the factual catalog plus ChangeSets, validations, decisions, and bundle projections, and publication is the only external write path.",
