      "statement": "ChangeSetService is the durable review boundary for proposed authoring changes: it accepts only known sources, requires 1 to 100 create/revise/deprecate operations, canonicalizes and hashes normalized content, enforces embedded OKF document validity, and rejects documents whose tenant or area diverge from the resolved ChangeSet scope.",
