      "id": "claim_030c60ed09a74ecdb952b5681a920976",
      "statement": "GitHub publication can start only from an already approved ChangeSet revision and content hash, derives a deterministic branch from the ChangeSet id and approved content hash, and reserves publication state idempotently on the hashed idempotency key plus canonical request hash before any external step proceeds.",
