      "statement": "The GitHub publication saga is approval-gated per native tool step, advancing through search, branch creation, file push, PR creation, and PR verification, and if an approved write step has an ambiguous external outcome the publication is forced into intervention-required state instead of being treated as a clean failure or success.",
