      "id": "claim_3ec85baf50ea4abe863bc0298e6fb8cd",
      "statement": "Compensation is explicit and admin-gated: publication compensation requires the current publication ETag, delegates to reconciler compensation, and can delete created agent, skill, or toolbox versions when a version was recorded, but it does not promise that every external side effect is always automatically reversible.",
