    {
      "id": "claim_0d9465b3166a4a1599a74af0525cf1c6",
      "statement": "ADR-032 defines the architectural reason for this workflow: OKF should express intent and review state without becoming a second operational catalog, proposer and publication stay separate, and publication must be implemented as a compensable saga because downstream services do not offer one distributed transaction.",
