      "statement": "The focused GitHub publication contract test proves that each native tool is presented for approval before execution, file output is normalized and deterministic, completed publications replay safely under the same key, area isolation and exact Approver authority are enforced, sanitized persistence avoids secrets and raw responses, and ambiguous write outcomes require intervention rather than replay.",
